---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Riverside ADU Guide | Inland Empire Homeowner Resource"
  description="A local resource for Riverside and Inland Empire homeowners exploring ADU, garage conversion, and junior ADU projects."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="site-wrapper">
      <h1>Planning an ADU in Riverside? Get Prepared Before You Call Contractors.</h1>
      <p>Riverside ADU Guide helps local homeowners understand ADU options, cost ranges, garage conversions, junior ADUs, permit questions, and contractor red flags before the first appointment.</p>
      <p>Before you invite strangers into your home, get clear on what to expect.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/free-adu-prep-check">Get a Free ADU Property Preview</a>
      <p><a class="hero-secondary-link" href="/adu-cost-guide">Read the Riverside ADU Cost Guide</a></p>
      <p class="trust-note">No cost. No contractor sales pitch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="trust-bar">
    <div class="trust-bar-inner">
      <span class="trust-bar-item">&#10003; No contractor sales pitch</span>
      <span class="trust-bar-item">&#10003; Riverside-specific info</span>
      <span class="trust-bar-item">&#10003; Local construction experience</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="site-wrapper">
  <section class="pain">
    <h2>Most Homeowners Start Calling Contractors Before They Know What to Expect</h2>
    <p>That is when the process gets stressful.</p>
    <p>One contractor says one thing. Another gives a completely different price. Someone says permits are easy. Someone else says the project is complicated. Before you know it, you are comparing strangers, numbers, promises, and pressure without really knowing what is normal.</p>
    <p>This guide exists to help Riverside homeowners slow down, get organized, and understand the basics before making expensive decisions.</p>
    <p>You should not feel defenseless when the first contractor walks through your door.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="helps-with">
    <h2>Know Your Options Before You Start</h2>
    <p>Riverside ADU Guide helps you understand:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Detached ADUs</li>
      <li>Garage conversion ADUs</li>
      <li>Junior ADUs / JADUs</li>
      <li>Common ADU cost ranges</li>
      <li>Permit and planning questions</li>
      <li>Contractor red flags</li>
      <li>Quote comparison basics</li>
      <li>Questions to ask before hiring anyone</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The goal is simple: give homeowners more power, more clarity, and better questions before they start collecting quotes.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="prep-check">
    <h2>Want a First Look at Your Property Before Calling Contractors?</h2>
    <p>Start with a free ADU Property Preview.</p>
    <p>Enter your property address, project goal, timeline, and biggest question. We will review the basic information and help you understand which ADU path may be worth exploring next.</p>
    <p>This may include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Detached ADU</li>
      <li>Garage conversion</li>
      <li>Junior ADU</li>
      <li>Addition or conversion</li>
      <li>&ldquo;Not sure yet&rdquo; planning direction</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This is not an official permit approval, legal opinion, architectural plan, or engineering review. It is a preliminary homeowner planning review based on available information and common ADU planning factors.</p>
    <a class="cta-link" href="/free-adu-prep-check">Start My Free ADU Property Preview</a>
  </section>

  <section class="why-guide">
    <h2>Built for Riverside Homeowners Who Want to Avoid Rushed Decisions</h2>
    <p>After years around remodeling projects, estimates, crews, and homeowner appointments, one thing becomes clear: the first meeting is easier when the homeowner is prepared.</p>
    <p>Many people start calling contractors because they are excited, overwhelmed, or worried they are already behind. But the fastest available person is not always the right person. A low price is not always a good deal. A confident salesman is not always the safest choice.</p>
    <p>Riverside ADU Guide was created to help homeowners understand the process before they are pressured into decisions.</p>
    <p>We are building a local resource for homeowners who want to ask smarter questions, avoid obvious red flags, and move forward with more confidence.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-links">
    <h2>Start With These Riverside ADU Guides</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/adu-cost-guide">ADU Cost Guide for Riverside Homeowners</a></li>
      <li><a href="/garage-conversion">Garage Conversion ADU Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/junior-adu-guide">Junior ADU / JADU Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/permits-guide">Riverside ADU Permits Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contractor-red-flags">ADU Contractor Red Flags</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Each guide is written to be simple, practical, and homeowner-friendly.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="local-trust">
    <h2>Local, Practical, and Homeowner-First</h2>
    <p>Riverside ADU Guide is not a generic national lead site pretending to know your city.</p>
    <p>This project is being built from Riverside, with real remodeling and project-management experience behind it. The goal is to help local homeowners understand their options before they call contractors, compare quotes, or start planning an ADU.</p>
    <p>Over time, this site will grow into a stronger local resource with checklists, case studies, contractor questions, homeowner stories, and trusted professional connections.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>Before You Call Contractors, Get Prepared</h2>
    <p>If you are thinking about an ADU, garage conversion, or junior ADU in Riverside or the Inland Empire, start with the basics.</p>
    <p>Get clear on your options, your questions, and the red flags to watch for.</p>
    <a class="cta-link" href="/free-adu-prep-check">Get My Free ADU Property Preview</a>
  </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
